   Liu, Shangru, Shaanxi Prov Transport Planning Design \& Res Inst, Xian, Peoples R China.
   Shao, Yang, Xian Univ Posts \& Telecommun, Sch Modern Posts, Logist Sch, Xian, Peoples R China.
   Shao, Yang, Xian Univ Posts \& Telecommun, Inst Posts, Xian, Peoples R China.},
